Required attribution
--------------------
These data are derived from:

  Paunikar S, Galanopoulos G, Rebillat M.
  "An experimental data set for the SHM of a substructure of an engine fan
  blade from the MORPHO project." Zenodo, 2025.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14627730

Changes made: the raw acquisitions have been converted to HDF5/CSV, restricted
to the strain and MTS-stiffness channels, and organised per panel (FOD3-FOD7).

The data were produced within the H2020 MORPHO project, grant agreement
No 101006854.

